<title>USA: Avalon Properties to take Q4 gain from sale.</title>
<headline>Avalon Properties to take Q4 gain from sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avalon Properties Inc said on Tuesday that it has sold two apartment complexes for $32.65 million, leading to a projected fourth quarter gain of $8 million.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the sale are to be used to reduce outstanding borrowings under its unsecured credit facilities and for new acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company sold two garden apartment complexes known as Avalon Brooke and Avalon Heights in Middletown to Sentinel Real Estate Corp on behalf of a separate account investor, it said.</p>
</text>
